{"3979870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Birds Watching", "steam_appid": 3979870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birds Watching</strong> is a short psychological horror about bird watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An endless global fire destroyed the world, and you are now alone, the last human being.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You survive on the top of a mountain, the only place still untouched by the flames, and your only occupation is watching with your binoculars the wild birds escaped up there with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a peaceful, isolated, desperate life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until you are not alone anymore, and the only ones who can save you are the birds; but they are picky. Satisfy them, or lose everything. Be honest. Be ruthless. Be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birds are watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but impactful open-world horror experience (~60 minutes).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/de99ba528fc51e748a75b65161370531.poster.avif?t=1773307117\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/de99ba528fc51e748a75b65161370531.webm?t=1773307117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/de99ba528fc51e748a75b65161370531.mp4?t=1773307117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go birding! Observe, catalog, and find every bird in the reserve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/8bd286131cc1136ecd908ef35a0a8844.poster.avif?t=1773307117\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/8bd286131cc1136ecd908ef35a0a8844.webm?t=1773307117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/8bd286131cc1136ecd908ef35a0a8844.mp4?t=1773307117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted open world full of secrets and hidden locations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/f3c808f152dba33655bc3fd017ee472f.poster.avif?t=1773307117\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/f3c808f152dba33655bc3fd017ee472f.webm?t=1773307117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/f3c808f152dba33655bc3fd017ee472f.mp4?t=1773307117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your animal companion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979870/extras/5e4304a62aa55527a45beffc55fe87ee.poster.avif?t=1773307117\" width=